  "caveats": [
    "PRECISION, measured 2026-08-26 (bean qou-syit): 57 payload fields are raw float64. 33 originate in this producer; 24 are INHERITED from light_isotope_sweep.tr_M_at_q0, whose pipeline is numpy + BlockCache(float(Q0), H_VAL) end to end. Because B_pred_MeV sums T1_descended, EVERY headline number here is float64-derived no matter what this producer does locally — so the 33 were deliberately NOT cosmetically converted. Per AGENTS.md a float64 input poisons the whole result, and dressing the survivors in mpf would hide that rather than fix it. Only the two provenance parameters with exact sources (q_0, m_e_MeV) are recorded exactly. Making this witness genuinely clean means porting light_isotope_sweep off numpy/BlockCache — a real tranche, with 3 module-importers (NOT the 118 a bare-name grep for tr_M_at_q0 returns; that name is shared across modules).",
    "T6 Habiro Laurent expansion deferred — placeholder = 0. k≥3 tail subtractive form only for atoms with entanglement-orders data (D, T, ³He). ⁴He+ k≥3 = 0 (data not yet in witness).",
    "Term 5 = 0 for A < 3 is STRUCTURAL not special-casing: BW formula's bulk/surface ratio inverts at A < 3 (volume subdominant), so BW formula is mathematically invalid there."
